## Hints for Future Agents
Spec-training requests must rely on spec_training_data_id to force CaptureHiddenMode.FULL. Do not add return_hidden_states=True: non-store TP ranks synchronously copy and serialize hidden states to the host. Check both prefill and train-with-decode paths on future rebases.

## Codebase Discoveries
The in-tree SGLang v0.5.14 patch explicitly makes batch.spec_training_info force full hidden capture. It also restricts Mooncake transfer processing to attention TP rank zero, confirming that the extra return flag is unnecessary.

